Author: Kairi Labs

Version:
    Major: 1
    Minor: 1
    Revision: 1

Targets: # 0 for all games

Title: ControlMole

Summary: Mole keeps your play time in check

Description: |
  Counts the minutes you play in every game and writes them where the
  ControlMole app can read them. When your daily limit is up, Mole pops up
  in the game and asks you to call it a day.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
